      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Office of Lower Manhattan Development.\nThere is established in the Executive Office of the Mayor the Office of Lower Manhattan Development which shall be headed by a Director of Lower Manhattan Development who shall be appointed by and serve at the pleasure of the Mayor.",
